  "definition": "Construction and Design of Building and Facilities",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-11-27",
  "historyNote": "#1682, eff 12-21-80; ss by #1930, eff 1-26-82; ss by #3069, eff 7-23-85; ss by #4658, eff 7-31-89; ss by #5383, eff 4-22-92, EXPIRED: 4-22-98 New. #7979, eff 10-22-03; ss by #10012, INTERIM, eff 10-22-11, EXPIRES: 4-19-12; ss by #10116, eff 4-19-12; ss by #12680, eff 11-27-18",
